{
  "uid": "gs08-matriculas",
  "title": "GS08 - Matriculas y Notas | API RED",
  "description": "Panel operativo del API FastAPI: disponibilidad, trafico, errores y latencia (metodo RED). Agrega las 2 instancias que nginx balancea.",
  "tags": ["gs08", "api", "red", "fastapi"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-3h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "instancia",
        "label": "Instancia del API",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(up{job=\"gs08-api\"}, instancia)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "refresh": 2
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "1. Disponibilidad del API (up)",
      "description": "1 = Prometheus logra scrapear /metrics de esa instancia; 0 = instancia caida o sin responder. Con 2 instancias arriba el servicio sigue disponible si una cae.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "up{job=\"gs08-api\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instancia}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "CAIDO", "color": "red", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "OK", "color": "green", "index": 1 } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "2. Peticiones por segundo (todas las instancias)",
      "description": "Tasa de peticiones HTTP por segundo sumando ambas instancias: carga total que esta atendiendo el sistema.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"gs08-api\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "decimals": 2, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "3. Tasa de errores 5xx (%)",
      "description": "Porcentaje de respuestas 5xx sobre el total en la ventana de 5 min. Objetivo: < 1%. Si supera 5% el panel se pone naranja/rojo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"gs08-api\", status=~\"5..\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"gs08-api\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[5m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "5xx %"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 5 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "4. Errores de cliente 4xx (%)",
      "description": "Porcentaje de respuestas 4xx (validaciones, 401 de login fallido, 404, 409 de matricula duplicada) sobre el total. Un 4xx alto con 5xx en cero indica que las reglas de negocio estan rechazando datos como se espera. NOTA: el gauge de peticiones en curso no existe en prometheus-fastapi-instrumentator 8.1.0; si @dev agrega una metrica propia de concurrencia se añade un panel aqui.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"gs08-api\", status=~\"4..\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"gs08-api\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[5m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "4xx %"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "yellow" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 5 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "5. Trafico por instancia (req/s)",
      "description": "Prueba visible de que nginx reparte la carga: las dos series (api y api-b) deben subir y bajar juntas. Si una serie se queda en 0, nginx no esta balanceando o la instancia no responde.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (instancia) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"gs08-api\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instancia}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "6. Latencia del API: p50 / p95 / p99",
      "description": "Percentiles del tiempo de respuesta en segundos. Criterio del MVP: p95 < 0.5 s en las consultas de estudiantes y matriculas.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"gs08-api\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"gs08-api\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"gs08-api\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "p95" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.lineWidth", "value": 3 }, { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "7. Respuestas por codigo de estado (2xx / 4xx / 5xx)",
      "description": "Distribucion de codigos de respuesta por segundo. Los 4xx son validaciones/rechazos esperados (p. ej. matricula duplicada, login fallido); los 5xx son fallos del servidor y deben ser cero.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"gs08-api\", status=~\"2..\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "OK {{status}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"gs08-api\", status=~\"4..\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "Cliente {{status}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"gs08-api\", status=~\"5..\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "Servidor {{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 20, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" }, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "8. Top 5 endpoints por volumen de peticiones",
      "description": "Que recursos se usan mas (estudiantes, cursos, matriculas, auth). Ayuda a saber donde optimizar indices o paginar.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "topk(5, sum by (handler, method) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"gs08-api\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "reduce", "options": { "reducers": ["lastNotNull"] } }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "decimals": 3 },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "footer": { "show": false } }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "9. Latencia p95 por endpoint",
      "description": "Endpoint mas lento primero: es la lista de trabajo para optimizar consultas SQL y vistas.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (handler, le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"gs08-api\", instancia=~\"$instancia\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "reduce", "options": { "reducers": ["lastNotNull"] } }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 3, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 0.5 }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 }] } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "footer": { "show": false } }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Referencia: que mide cada panel",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 2, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Fuente de datos y metodo",
      "description": "Documentacion de los paneles",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 35 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Fuente:** `http_requests_total`, `http_request_duration_seconds` y `up`, expuestas por el API en `/metrics` (prometheus-fastapi-instrumentator) y recolectadas por Prometheus cada 15 s.\n\n| Panel | Que mide | Como se lee |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1. Disponibilidad (up) | Si Prometheus puede leer las metricas de cada instancia | Todo en OK = 2/2 instancias vivas; un CAIDO con trafico normal en el otro significa que nginx y el contenedor sobreviven a una caida |\n| 2. Peticiones/segundo | Carga total atendida | Numeros altos y sostenidos = mas usuarios; sirve para dimensionar replicas |\n| 3. Errores 5xx (%) | Calidad del servicio | Debe ser 0: cualquier valor > 0 es bug del API o de la BD |\n| 4. Errores 4xx (%) | Rechazos por validacion/negocio (401, 404, 409) | Alto con 5xx en cero = las reglas de negocio funcionan |\n| 5. Trafico por instancia | Balanceo de nginx | Las dos series deben moverse parejo (round-robin) |\n| 6. Latencia p50/p95/p99 | Experiencia de usuario | p95 < 0.5 s es el criterio de aceptacion del MVP |\n| 7. Respuestas por estado | Errores de cliente vs servidor | 4xx altos (401/404/409) = validaciones funcionando; 5xx = fallo |\n| 8. Top endpoints | Uso por recurso | Prioriza indices y paginacion en los primeros |\n| 9. Latencia p95 por endpoint | Endpoint mas lento | Primer candidato a optimizar |\n\n**No hay panel de MySQL/Postgres** porque no se agrego un exporter; se puede sumar `postgres-exporter` en el perfil `obs` en el siguiente sprint."
      }
    }
  ]
}
